#: ../../api/qfeval_functions.functions.skipna.rst:2
msgid "skipna"
msgstr ""

#: of qfeval_functions.functions.skipna.skipna:1
msgid "Applies the given data to the given function after removing NaNs."
msgstr "NaNを取り除いた上で、与えられたデータを与えられた関数に適用します。"

#: of qfeval_functions.functions.skipna.skipna:3
msgid ""
"This function makes a NaN-unaware function applicable to data containing "
"NaNs.  Along the specified dimension, it first packs the non-NaN values "
"to the front (preserving their order) followed by the NaN values, then "
"applies the given function ``f`` to the packed tensors, and finally "
"restores the results to the original positions of the non-NaN values. "
"Positions that had NaN in any of the input tensors are NaN in the output."
msgstr ""
"この関数は、NaNに対応していない関数をNaNを含むデータに適用できるようにします。指定された次元に沿って、まずNaNでない値を（順序を保ったまま）前方に詰め、その後ろにNaN値を配置します。次に、詰められたテンソルに関数"
" ``f`` を適用し、最後に結果をNaNでない値の元の位置に戻します。いずれかの入力テンソルでNaNだった位置は、出力でもNaNになります。"

#: of qfeval_functions.functions.skipna.skipna:11
msgid ""
"CAVEAT: The given function ``f`` must preserve the shape of its inputs "
"and must map the :math:`i`-th element of its input to the :math:`i`-th "
"element of its output (e.g., cumulative or element-wise operations)."
msgstr ""
"注意: 与えられる関数 ``f`` は入力の形状を保持し、入力の :math:`i` 番目の要素を出力の :math:`i` "
"番目の要素に対応付けるものでなければなりません（例: 累積演算や要素ごとの演算）。"

#: ../../api/qfeval_functions.functions.skipna.rst
msgid "Parameters"
msgstr "パラメータ"

#: of qfeval_functions.functions.skipna.skipna:16
msgid ""
"The function to apply.  It takes as many tensors as ``xs`` and returns a "
"tensor of the same shape."
msgstr "適用する関数。``xs`` と同じ数のテンソルを受け取り、同じ形状のテンソルを返します。"

#: of qfeval_functions.functions.skipna.skipna:20
msgid ""
"The input tensors.  They must have the same shape.  If multiple tensors "
"are given, positions where any tensor has NaN are treated as missing in "
"all of them."
msgstr "入力テンソル。すべて同じ形状でなければなりません。複数のテンソルが与えられた場合、いずれかのテンソルでNaNである位置は、すべてのテンソルで欠損として扱われます。"

#: of qfeval_functions.functions.skipna.skipna:25
msgid ""
"The dimension along which to pack non-NaN values. Default is -1 (the last"
" dimension)."
msgstr "NaNでない値を詰める次元。デフォルトは -1（最後の次元）です。"

#: ../../api/qfeval_functions.functions.skipna.rst
msgid "Returns"
msgstr "戻り値"

#: of qfeval_functions.functions.skipna.skipna:29
msgid ""
"A tensor of the same shape as the input, containing the result of ``f`` "
"applied to the non-NaN values, with NaN at positions where any input "
"tensor has NaN."
msgstr "NaNでない値に ``f`` を適用した結果を含む、入力と同じ形状のテンソル。いずれかの入力テンソルがNaNである位置はNaNになります。"

#: ../../api/qfeval_functions.functions.skipna.rst
msgid "Return type"
msgstr "戻り値の型"

#: of qfeval_functions.functions.skipna.skipna:35
msgid "Example"
msgstr "使用例"

#: of qfeval_functions.functions.skipna.skipna:37
msgid ""
">>> # Cumulative sum, skipping NaNs.\n"
">>> x = torch.tensor([1.0, nan, 2.0, nan, 3.0])\n"
">>> QF.skipna(lambda a: a.cumsum(-1), x)\n"
"tensor([1., nan, 3., nan, 6.])"
msgstr ">>> # NaNをスキップした累積和。\n>>> x = torch.tensor([1.0, nan, 2.0, nan, 3.0])\n>>> QF.skipna(lambda a: a.cumsum(-1), x)\ntensor([1., nan, 3., nan, 6.])"

#: of qfeval_functions.functions.skipna.skipna:42
msgid ""
":func:`apply_for_axis`: Applies a function expecting 2D input along a "
"dimension."
msgstr ":func:`apply_for_axis`: 2次元入力を想定した関数を指定した次元に沿って適用します。"

#: of qfeval_functions.functions.skipna.skipna:44
msgid ":func:`fillna`: Replace NaN values instead of removing them."
msgstr ":func:`fillna`: NaN値を除去する代わりに置き換えます。"

